      "hasWhois": true,
      "hasColourWhois": true,
      "hasAscii": false,
      "asciiScore": 0.0,
      "whoisText": "Amandil the Last Lord of Andúnië is a\n    Vala (Architect) [Retired].\n\nLord of Andúnië and father of Elendil. Dismissed by Sauron he sailed into the\nWest to plead for the misdeeds of the Númenóreans. Upon reaching the shores of\nValinor, Manwë appeared and listened but would not change his plans for war.\nInstead, he gave the Man the choice to return to the mortal land or join the\nValar in their struggle against evil. Amandil chose the latter and was trusted\nwith Grond, seized from the hands of Morgoth, and given tools to shape new\nlands.\n",
      "whoisTextPath": "data/evidence/whois_display/text/amandil.txt",
