      "asciiScore": 0.0,
      "whoisText": "Elemmakil, Captain of the Gate of Wood\n    is a Maia (Cartographer).\nLast login 5 years, 10 months, and\n    12 days ago from *.net.\n\n   Elemmakil was a Noldorin Elf, the captain of those who guarded the outer\nentranceway to Gondolin. Here, he encountered Tuor and Voronwë, journeying\nto the land at the command of Ulmo. Elemmakil was their guide through the\nSeven Gates that guarded Gondolin, until he gave them into the keeping of\nhis own captain, the Warden of the Great Gate, Ecthelion of the Fountain.\n",
