      "asciiScore": 0.0,
      "whoisText": "Khatog Kheledhras, emissary of Mahal is a Maia.\nLast login 18 years, 6 months, and 14 days ago from *.net.\nKhatog was born in the Blue Mountains, and he spent all his mortal\nlife as an ideal dwarf. He wielded a mighty hammer, and above all loved\nthe crafts of mining and smithing. He was always willing to help out fellow\nDwarves, as well as anyone else who he befriended. After many years of mortal\nlife, he finally grew weary of the world and sailed into the west, where he was\nmade one of the Maiar of Mahal, and his spirit immortalized. Several of his\nfriends remained in the mortal world, and to this day they follow his path:\nMabzur, Flëgel, Jonin and Ritich.\n",
