      "hasAscii": false,
      "asciiScore": 0.0,
      "whoisText": "Science wanders arda like a ghost is a Maia (Builder) [Retired].\nIs playing from *.san.jose.  Msn/yahoo: poetry_creation@hotmail/yahoo.com\n\n*a Science* has arrived from above.\n*a Science* begins some strange incantations...\n*a Science* utters the words 'noselacri'\nYou have been blinded by the light of Science!\n\nHe grew up in the shire, a happy and wild hobbit.  Everyone knew he would\ngo places.  And he has - now he's a god!\n\nI must go down to the seas again, to the lonely sea and the sky,\nAnd all I ask is a tall ship and a star to steer her by,\nAnd the wheel's kick and the wind's song and the white sail's shaking,\nAnd a gray mist on the sea's face, and a gray dawn breaking.\np(Dernhalm, Gail, Opa, Katari, Dundan, Fantasy, Sharkey, Angst)\n",
